125300         MOVE DATE-YMD-OUT        TO  PO-FOLLOWUP-DATE
125400     ELSE
125500         MOVE DATE-YMD-OUT        TO  PO-FOLLOWUP-DATE.
           IF PO-FOLLOWUP-YY > "70"
               MOVE "19" TO PO-FOLLOWUP-DATE-CC
           ELSE
               MOVE "20" TO PO-FOLLOWUP-DATE-CC
           END-IF.
125600******************************************************
125700**   IF VIEW-LASTKEY = 1 THEN THE USER JUST WANTED TO
125800**   UPDATE FOLLOWUP DATE AND DOESNT WANT TO SEND A
125900**   FOLLOWUP NOTICE SO NO. OF FOLLOWUPS DOES NOT
126000**   NEED TO BE UPDATED OTHERWISE UPDATE NO. OF
126100**   FOLLOWUPS
126200******************************************************
126300     IF VIEW-LASTKEY = 1
126400         NEXT SENTENCE
126500     ELSE
